PLACEHOLDER - THIS FILE DOES NOT CONTAIN A KEY YET

This file will hold the ASCII-armored public part of the Flexiv RDK release signing key, exported
with:

    gpg --armor --export <FINGERPRINT> > cmake/flexiv_release_key.asc

When it is replaced, also set FLEXIV_RDK_RELEASE_KEY_FINGERPRINT in CMakeLists.txt to the key's
full 40-character fingerprint, and publish the same fingerprint as described in SECURITY.md.
Until then, configuring with -DFLEXIV_RDK_VERIFY_SIGNATURE=ON fails on purpose.
